        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <header class="hero">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="brand">
          <img class="logo" src="/tripwire/tripwire-logo.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />
          <h1>Tripwire Docs</h1>
        </div>
        <p class="tag">
          When an issue your team depends on slips — due date pushed later, punted from a sprint,
          or gone quiet — Tripwire notifies the dependent team's assignee and lead automatically,
          right on the issue. No rules to write, no Automation quota, all inside Atlassian.
        </p>
        <div class="badges">
          <span class="badge">Runs on Atlassian</span>
          <span class="badge">No external data egress</span>
          <span class="badge">Zero Automation quota</span>
